There is a game called "myth" which is a (simpler) multi-user
hack-style game.  It's quite fun to play, but if you want a good
(but also simple) multi-user game I'd recommend xtrek (you need
X-windows) which is a 4-team shoot-em-up/from-alliances-on-the-fly
game with neat graphics.

I can't remember where I got myth from.  Xtrek came off the net around
a month ago in (I think) comp.sources.x.  If you're in the UK you can
copy myth from my site with (eg):

	cpf -b '<PUB>/games/myth-1.02a+.tar.Z@uk.ac.soton.ecs'

with login "guest" and password "yourname@yoursite".  It really
needs Unix and hogs of memory!

Tim.


